      "extract": "[]{#intro label=\"intro\"} In [@MO], Morton proved a formula relating the colored Jones polynomials of a cabling of a knot to the colored Jones polynomials of the original knot. Using this formula, Kashaev proved that the volume conjecture is true for the torus knots [@KT]. The original proof of Morton is written in the language of quantum groups. In this paper, an alternative way using skein theory is adopted.",
      "extractCut": true
    },
